  "line": 53,
  "title": "AC-5: take coordinator load from EngineDeps.loadSource",
  "detail": "Still unmet (reproduced): in-place and LAN-fallback executions read `job.load_per_core`. The separate in-place process has its own WorkerStore, so the Factory's injection never reaches it. With the engine load injected as 12.75, the tests recorded 3.25 (in-place) and 4.5 (LAN fallback). Minimal fix: `const load = coordinator ? (ctx.deps.loadSource ?? hostLoadPerCore)() : null;`. Existing rows stay immutable through ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING. Then remove the completion-load machinery the spec didn't ask for: the extra migration column (~13), WorkerStore completion-load capture (workers.ts ~770) and Factory worker-load injection (app.ts ~111). The PR is at 333 source lines against a 320 stop."
 },
 {
  "id": "F2",
