  "line": 77,
  "title": "Redact the worker identity before persisting it",
  "detail": "`failure_observations.location` is written from `job.worker` without `redactCredentials`. A worker name containing a registered credential is stored verbatim (reproduced). Redact it before persistence, as the other evidence fields are."
 },
 {
  "id": "F3",
